// Base build configuration for SymbolScan.
//
// Machine-specific overrides — most importantly your code-signing DEVELOPMENT_TEAM —
// belong in Local.xcconfig, which is git-ignored. Copy Local.xcconfig.example to
// Local.xcconfig and fill in your Apple Development team so local builds sign with a
// stable identity. That stable signature is what keeps the macOS Accessibility grant
// alive across rebuilds; without it you'd have to re-approve the app every time.
//
// The include is optional (note the `?`): CI and fresh checkouts that have no
// Local.xcconfig still build, with an empty team — matching the CI flags
// (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO, DEVELOPMENT_TEAM="").
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
